Nairobi is situated at 1°09′S 36°39′E﻿ / ﻿1.150°S 36.650°E﻿ / -1.150; 36.650﻿ (Nairobi, Kenya) and 1°27′S 37°06′E﻿ / ﻿1.450°S 37.100°E﻿ / -1.450; 37.100﻿ (Nairobi, Kenya) and occupies 696 square kilometres (270 sq mi). ([Geography](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nairobi#Geography))

