## multimedia

Nairobi is diverse in African cultures. As a cosmopolitan African city, it hosts all the diverse tribes that make up Kenya, and hosts a large immigrant population from other African countries. ([Culture](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nairobi#Culture))

